WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:07.680
My name is Pin Saruta Kiatparkpoom,
and I'm an artist working in metal.

00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:10.040
My role involves
reimagining waste material

00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:11.400
to create unique pieces of homeware.

00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:14.640
I use the scrap metal from
my family's factory, and transform it

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:17.400
into one-of-a-kind items.
This is what my business is all about.

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:25.960
Not all rubbish needs to be thrown away,
some materials can be re-worked

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:29.400
into something new.

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:36.400
After studying fine art, I returned
to my family's metalwork business

00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:39.640
to help it grow and develop.

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:43.000
I realised scrap iron was
a versatile material,

00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:45.560
so I combined it
with my passion for art and craft.

00:00:53.320 --> 00:00:58.240
The thing that's special about my work
is the detailing.

00:00:59.360 --> 00:01:02.000
The machines we use create patterns
on the offcuts,

00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:04.960
and it's this repetitive detail

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:08.760
that makes my signature style
so unique.

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:15.760
I was born into an industry that isn't
usually associated with art and craft,

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:21.360
but we have the power to change this.

00:01:24.280 --> 00:01:28.680
We can learn so much from our ancestors.

00:01:28.760 --> 00:01:30.640
I think the new generation
should look to the past

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:33.000
to inform their work.

00:01:33.080 --> 00:01:35.640
If we allow the old and new worlds
to co-exist,

00:01:35.720 --> 00:01:39.880
the possibilities of craft are
endless. This is my philosophy.

00:01:44.360 --> 00:01:47.400
My main purpose is to help others
achieve their full potential.

00:01:48.560 --> 00:01:50.320
Craft can transform lives.

00:01:51.520 --> 00:01:53.600
I want to create opportunities

00:01:53.680 --> 00:01:55.600
for people who work in this industry.

00:01:55.680 --> 00:01:57.840
It's important my staff
feel proud of their work,

00:01:57.920 --> 00:02:02.520
and have the opportunity
to hone their skills independently

00:02:02.600 --> 00:02:06.040
through craft.

00:02:06.120 --> 00:02:09.200
I believe that, with the right support,

00:02:09.280 --> 00:02:12.040
people can feel empowered at work.

00:02:20.040 --> 00:02:21.920
It's essential.

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:26.600
Craft can create positive
change for individuals.

00:02:31.880 --> 00:02:36.360
My mission here in Thailand
is to cultivate interest in craftwork,

00:02:36.440 --> 00:02:40.240
and demonstrate the importance

00:02:40.320 --> 00:02:42.800
of protecting and championing
such a vital industry.

